{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"850779383656218636","content":"I mean, i’ve only been here a little while, and, while I honestly only expected Secel to have a life expectancy of one day and to never really develop her given how i really didn’t put much into her to begin with, I’m very happy that she’s made actual friends, and i’m not going into a relationship territory unless Wrask wants to. Not gonna force it as i kinda feel i did with her even getting to a point of asking to get to know him. \n\nAnd, well, I was kinda afraid the whole ideas of Secel trying to learn her heritage and learn about things in her past was gonna get shot down. I mean, I’m still getting used to all of this amazing content that I’m still trying to learn how things work ( And yes, it’s going to **A LOT** IC, so be prepared for newb moves. Hell, point and laugh if ya want ). It feels good to have some freedom with personal stories and not feel weird about it","created_at":"2021-07-15T19:33:42.655000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865315209211805697","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
